0.2 10.2 0 002.14-11.96l-.77.73a9.1 9.1 0 01.83 3.81c0 5.25-4.48 9.53-9.98 9.53s-9.98-4.28-9.98-9.53c0-5.25 4.48-9.53 9.98-9.53 3.4 0 6.42 1.64 8.22 4.13l.74-.7A11.2 11.2 0 0012 1C9.06 1 6.3 2.1 4.22 4.08a10.2 10.2 0 000 14.84A11.2 11.2 0 0012 22z\" fill=\"#463F5B\" stroke=\"#463F5B\"></path><path d=\"M11.95 14.79L6.9 9.94a.54.54 0 00-.75 0c-.2.2-.2.52 0 .71l5.43 5.2a.54.54 0 00.74 0l8.89-8.5.79-.76 2.85-2.73c.2-.2.2-.52 0-.71a.54.54 0 00-.75 0L21.44 5.7l-.76.73-8.73 8.36z\" fill=\"#EE9D7F\" stroke=\"#EE9D7F\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWhen your referral completes their stay, we give you a $500 credit per week completed for you to come back for a future stay\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://na1.documents.adobe.com/public/esignWidget?wid=CBFCIBAA3AAABLblqZhBNwFsX2ZekXL4fXZnA9xFjXiAxexEg7Cx_O0QukLXBa1uCILQu7D1CYjEAn3LNgmg*\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBook a consultation\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Looking to make a career out of helping others and promoting Hippocrates? </h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>We’re always looking empathetic and emotionally intelligent individuals to participate in our Off Campus Global Program Specialist Team. With your help, we can educate people and transform lives on a whole new scale.</p><p>If you are interested in participating in this program, you can view full details of this contract through the application below.</p><p>Not only will you develop a career you’re passionate about, you’ll also help people take responsibility for their health.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://na1.documents.adobe.com/public/esignWidget?wid=CBFCIBAA3AAABLblqZhCYOxpdAkvkgPLNNv0